From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thibaut Lapierre <root@epheo.eu>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] ovn: enable admin network policy

enable-admin-network-policy=true, the AdminNetworkPolicy and
BaselineAdminNetworkPolicy CRDs (from cluster-network-operator) in
MicroShift's CRD list, and the controller's rights to read them and patch
their status. Needs 0010's RBAC context.

Covered by: vm-test (an AdminNetworkPolicy Deny cuts a pod off the
cluster network and its removal restores it).
---
